 "description": "ALBUM EDIT of mm11-the-return (fix1, 2026-09-26). Its album master is delivered as render/mm11-the-return-album.wav; the picture version stays the underscore master and the stems. Every section in picture order, on its own 96 grid: the Door twice (plain, then stopped on the heart), the floor at 2 bars a chord, LEVERAGE 9 bars, a 1-bar hold, the C pedal under the Build compiling 8 -> 12 -> 16 -> 4, the sign and 2 bars at full, the plates, the 1-bit flat line, the bonk rest, the felt settle ringing out. Fix 2b (2026-09-26): LEVERAGE's cello pizz on its own track, notched at 110.5 Hz (-12 dB, Q 16; rule 12), the F pedal (and the album edit's C pedal) re-bowed every 2 bars (the held sample ran out), the senza violin retuned (its C4 sample is 23 c sharp).",
