 "audition": [
  "0-15.62 s: the Door twice -- plain, then stopped dead at 13.5 s: does the second stop still land without the heart on screen?",
  "15.62-35.62 s: the floor at its full cycle (2 bars a chord): ironic beauty, not a warm resolution; the cut at 35.62 s",
  "37.5-60.62 s: 9 bars of LEVERAGE: a trap closing, never a loop that nags; the drop-out at 60.62 s. Fix 2b: the F pedal is re-bowed every 2 bars (at 43.12 s and every 5 s): is the bow change inaudible? The cello pizz is notched at 110.5 Hz: still woody, and minor?",
  "63.12-75.62 s: the C pedal (the dominant) under the Build compiling 8 -> 12 -> 16 -> 4 into the sign: joy, and the sign lands on A-flat, one size too big",
  "75.62-80.62 s: the stab and TWO bars at full -- one size too big, then cut to one chip note",
  "82.5 s to the end: F F F, the rest, the felt settle -- the right last word on an album?"
 ],
